<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_II__cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_II__cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
