<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_I__cl_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
