<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subperenggan (1) hanya terpakai jika Pihak Berkuasa—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
