<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
