<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Pihak Berkuasa hendaklah menyebabkan minit semua mesyuaratnya disenggarakan dan disimpan dalam bentuk yang sepatutnya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Apa-apa minit yang dibuat mengenai mesyuarat Pihak Berkuasa hendaklah, jika ditandatangani dengan sewajarnya oleh Pengerusi, boleh diterima sebagai keterangan dalam semua prosiding undang-undang tanpa bukti selanjutnya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Tiap-tiap mesyuarat Pihak Berkuasa yang berkenaan dengannya minit mengenai prosidingnya telah dibuat mengikut subperenggan (1) dan (2) hendaklah disifatkan telah dipanggil dan diadakan dengan sewajarnya dan semua anggota pada mesyuarat itu layak dengan sewajarnya untuk bertindak. Tatacara"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@/~sched_1__para_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Tertakluk kepada Akta ini, Pihak Berkuasa boleh mengawal selia tatacaranya sendiri. Kesahan perbuatan dan prosiding"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/53/msa@> .
